<title>TUNISIA: Markets closed in Tunisia for holidays.</title>
<headline>Markets closed in Tunisia for holidays.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Markets and public services were closed on Thursday in Tunisia for the Independence Day.</p>
<p>They also will remain closed on Friday for the Youth's Day.</p>
</text>
